/-! ## Kernels with vanishing moments of higher order

An `N`-fold difference of a compactly supported profile has vanishing moments
of every order below `N`.  This is the ingredient BRS use through the
factorization in (5.7), and it is what powers the kernel estimates (5.11). -/

/-- The alternating binomial sum against a power vanishes below the order. -/
